"Bash-nor is the Artonan Ambassador on Anesidora, with a residence at Punta de la Luna, Apex."
"Since Alden's return he kept an evacuation kit and an escape flyer ready for him."
"In the Matadero flooding he took his protective enchantments to shield the High Council."
"He throws many parties and lets Avowed test their powers against his house."
"In the flood he messaged all Avowed on Anesidora to trust their Contract's orders."
"Offended by Zeridee's actions in the flood, he wants her removed from her assignment."
"He is the main Artonan voice on Anesidoran news: small, in gray, slow and faintly condescending."
"Esh keeps him busy and told him not to bother Alden."
"Offended that Alis-art'h commended a human Ryeh-b't, he delayed Alden's evacuation briefing."
"He wants more humans assigned Ryeh-b't and opposes combat classes for many species."
"He dislikes Zeridee for trying to shift out of the wizard class."
"Zeridee calls him intolerant of slights from the weak and prone to pleasurable excesses."
"At Matadero he gave Alden 300,000 Argold and invited him to his parties."
"He calls Ro-den lazy and self-important."
"He is famous for wild parties and is an ally of Grand Senator Servin-ith."
"He claimed Avowed who failed to escape the flood chose to dawdle."
"In December 2040, after Graham tried to punch him, he was removed as ambassador."
